JohtoVictoryRoad_1F_Text_SilverIntro::
    .string "I used to think power meant\n"
    .string "taking whatever I wanted.\p"
    .string "You and LANCE stopped ROCKET.\n"
    .string "My partners stayed beside me.\p"
    .string "GOLBAT became CROBAT when I\n"
    .string "finally learned to trust it.\p"
    .string "Now face the team we built\n"
    .string "together!$"

JohtoVictoryRoad_1F_Text_SilverLoss::
    .string "So this is your real strength...$"

JohtoVictoryRoad_1F_Text_SilverAfter::
    .string "Stealing never made me stronger.\n"
    .string "My partners did.\p"
    .string "I will make amends with ELM.\n"
    .string "Go on. LANCE is waiting.$"

JohtoVictoryRoad_1F_Text_SilverWaiting::
    .string "SILVER is waiting at the end of\n"
    .string "the road. Settle your rivalry.$"

